ont-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit;\">. junija2026</span>, bo zaradi prireditve v <span data-end=\"252\" data-start=\"237\" style=\"font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: 700; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit;\">ŠRC Stožice</span> med <span data-end=\"286\" data-start=\"257\" style=\"font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: 700; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit;\">16 in predvidoma 20. uro</span> uvedena <span data-end=\"320\" data-start=\"295\" style=\"font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: 700; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit;\">posebna krožna linija</span> za obiskovalce prireditve.</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"615\" data-start=\"349\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0.9375rem; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.5625rem; font-family: aktiv-grotesk, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; color: rgb(89, 89, 89); clear: left;\">Krožna linija bo povezovala okoliška parkirišča (Žale I, II, III, IV in V, parkirišče Kranjčeva ulica in Gosarjeva) ter vozila po naslednji trasi:<br data-end=\"498\" data-start=\"495\"><span data-end=\"615\" data-start=\"498\" style=\"font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: 700; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit;\">Vojkova – Cesta Janeza Porente – del krožišča – Clevelandska – Tomačevska – Kranjčeva – Vojkova – Center Stožice.</span></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"615\" data-start=\"349\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0.9375rem; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.5625rem; font-family: aktiv-grotesk, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; color: rgb(89, 89, 89); clear: left;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamBusylj/LPPDetoursFetch/main/slike/c681780da3851dd69f61d064569a0b5d.png\"></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"615\" data-start=\"349\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0.9375rem; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.5625rem; font-family: aktiv-grotesk, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; color: rgb(89, 89, 89); clear: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"779\" data-start=\"617\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0.9375rem; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.5625rem; font-family: aktiv-grotesk, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; color: rgb(89, 89, 89); clear: left;\">Po končani prireditvi bodo <span data-end=\"667\" data-start=\"644\" style=\"font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: 700; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit;\">predvidoma ob 20. uri</span> zagotovljeni dodatni avtobusi na relaciji:<br data-end=\"713\" data-start=\"710\"><span data-end=\"779\" data-start=\"713\" style=\"font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: 700; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit;\">Vojkova cesta (postajališče Nove Stožice P+R) – Bavarski dvor.</span></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"861\" data-start=\"781\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0.9375rem; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.5625rem; font-family: aktiv-grotesk, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; color: rgb(89, 89, 89); clear: left;\">Zadnji odhodi avtobusov z Vojkove ceste bodo <span data-end=\"860\" data-start=\"826\" style=\"font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: 700; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit;\">20 minut po končani prireditvi</span>.</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"861\" data-start=\"781\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0.9375rem; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.5625rem; font-family: aktiv-grotesk, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; color: rgb(89, 89, 89); clear: left;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamBusylj/LPPDetoursFetch/main/slike/74b56b0ea472faac339f3ee4c0767167.png\"></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"861\" data-start=\"781\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0.9375rem; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.5625rem; font-family: aktiv-grotesk, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; color: rgb(89, 89, 89); clear: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"861\" data-start=\"781\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0.9375rem; font-v